{"4388880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Star TD", "steam_appid": 4388880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend a World That Changes Every Time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two battlefields are the same. Generation system creates diverse landscapes featuring treacherous pits, strategic hills, and vital resource veins. Scout the map to find the perfect vantage points for your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388880/extras/5ff0c485e0f6a739d27d0aef16adee49.poster.avif?t=1787045532\" width=854 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388880/extras/5ff0c485e0f6a739d27d0aef16adee49.webm?t=1787045532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388880/extras/5ff0c485e0f6a739d27d0aef16adee49.mp4?t=1787045532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource-Driven Strategy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't build everywhere. You must Mine Nodes scattered across the map. Protect your refineries at all costs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388880/extras/6ed655047d511c868f01b798b608c514.poster.avif?t=1787045532\" width=854 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388880/extras/6ed655047d511c868f01b798b608c514.webm?t=1787045532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388880/extras/6ed655047d511c868f01b798b608c514.mp4?t=1787045532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Research &amp; Growth</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory or defeat, the grind never stops. Use earned Research Points to navigate a branching Tech Tree with unique upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388880/extras/35d36de6f8e52be7d7e32b6eb58bd7a8.poster.avif?t=1787045532\" width=854 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388880/extras/35d36de6f8e52be7d7e32b6eb58bd7a8.webm?t=1787045532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388880/extras/35d36de6f8e52be7d7e32b6eb58bd7a8.mp4?t=1787045532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend a World That Changes Every Time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two battlefields are the same. Generation system creates diverse landscapes featuring treacherous pits, strategic hills, and vital resource veins. Scout the map to find the perfect vantage points for your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388880/extras/5ff0c485e0f6a739d27d0aef16adee49.poster.avif?t=1787045532\" width=854 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388880/extras/5ff0c485e0f6a739d27d0aef16adee49.webm?t=1787045532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388880/extras/5ff0c485e0f6a739d27d0aef16adee49.mp4?t=1787045532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource-Driven Strategy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't build everywhere. You must Mine Nodes scattered across the map. Protect your refineries at all costs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388880/extras/6ed655047d511c868f01b798b608c514.poster.avif?t=1787045532\" width=854 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388880/extras/6ed655047d511c868f01b798b608c514.webm?t=1787045532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388880/extras/6ed655047d511c868f01b798b608c514.mp4?t=1787045532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Research &amp; Growth</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory or defeat, the grind never stops. Use earned Research Points to navigate a branching Tech Tree with unique upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388880/extras/35d36de6f8e52be7d7e32b6eb58bd7a8.poster.avif?t=1787045532\" width=854 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388880/extras/35d36de6f8e52be7d7e32b6eb58bd7a8.webm?t=1787045532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388880/extras/35d36de6f8e52be7d7e32b6eb58bd7a8.mp4?t=1787045532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Command your defense in an ever-changing roguelite TD. Harvest resources from mine nodes, explore the fog of war, and repel alien waves. With a deep branching tech tree and permanent progression, every defeat is just a step toward ultimate power. Build. Die. Research. Repeat.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388880/a9c0f9751250d0370ec050d722910f9d04378727/header.jpg?t=1787045532", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388880/1f662233f689fd9a82759455eb35fa2284e7b02d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787045532", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388880/1f662233f689fd9a82759455eb35fa2284e7b02d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787045532", "website": "https://bidi.bid/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5 3 GHz+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4 GB Direct3D 11 Capable video card or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5 3 GHz+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 8 GB Direct3D 11 Capable video card or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Viktor Martynovsky"], "publishers": ["Viktor Martynovsky"], "demos": [{"appid": 4504790, "description": ""}, {"appid": 4504790, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 62, "descripti